1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,950
Every time you don’t click a link… someone loses money.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,070
The old deal was simple.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,740
You searched. Ten blue links. One click paid the website.

4
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,760
But now AI answers on top.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,420
So you don’t click.

6
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:18,143
One study: Google traffic to publishers fell 40% in a year.

7
00:00:18,193 --> 00:00:22,008
Condé Nast told its teams: plan as if search is zero.

8
00:00:22,058 --> 00:00:25,048
So websites may write for AIs… not for you.

9
00:00:25,098 --> 00:00:27,708
And when no one clicks… who gets paid?
